{
  "name": "IIoT - Resposta automática do WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Resposta automática do número da plataforma\n\n1. Na Evolution, na instância da plataforma, configure o **webhook** com a URL de produção do nó **Mensagem recebida** e o evento **MESSAGES_UPSERT**.\n2. Preencha **Configuração** (mesmos dados da Evolution do fluxo do resumo).\n\nResponde só a mensagens de pessoas (não grupos, não as próprias), **uma vez por contato a cada 24 h**.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8ac86550-f62b-4d22-a56d-f3135a06b1ec",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "everlenz-iiot-whatsapp",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3219356c-9db2-4a62-bcb1-fda629a40756",
      "name": "Mensagem recebida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "2cbb3c30-c264-4b91-915d-2ca99b8f2801"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "842419b1-4bd0-4922-a444-db5112f30b38",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_URL",
              "value": "https://evolutionapi.assistentedrfin.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "007903b0-c098-454d-89ed-40cfa012a54b",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA",
              "value": "NOME_DA_INSTANCIA",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4e7a8f9-47f7-41fc-a006-9b69685f08f2",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_APIKEY",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_APIKEY_DA_EVOLUTION",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2d1e434c-ba43-4146-bcfb-aa4e4701a861",
              "name": "RESPOSTA",
              "value": "Olá! Este número só envia o resumo diário de produção da Everlenz IIoT. Para ver os detalhes e acompanhar em tempo real, acesse o painel: https://iotplataform.everlenz.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d7608555-bc58-49ce-86b9-347e19a47854",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const body = $('Mensagem recebida').first().json.body ?? {};\nconst data = Array.isArray(body.data) ? body.data[0] : body.data ?? {};\nconst jid = String(data?.key?.remoteJid ?? '');\nconst event = String(body.event ?? '').toLowerCase().replace('_', '.');\n// Only a person writing to us: not our own sends, not groups, not status.\nif (event !== 'messages.upsert' || data?.key?.fromMe || !jid.endsWith('@s.whatsapp.net')) return [];\nconst memory = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nmemory.answered = memory.answered ?? {};\nconst now = Date.now();\n// Once per contact per day; old entries are forgotten so the memory stays small.\nfor (const [key, at] of Object.entries(memory.answered)) if (now - at > 86400000) delete memory.answered[key];\nif (memory.answered[jid]) return [];\nmemory.answered[jid] = now;\nreturn [{ json: { number: jid.split('@')[0], waitSeconds: 3 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 6) } }];"
      },
      "id": "0d68473c-4ad1-49c6-a322-fa783fa7b126",
      "name": "Responder a este contato?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $json.waitSeconds }}"
      },
      "id": "5926a808-e62e-4e2d-9158-ff7792467afe",
      "name": "Espera curta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').item.json.EVOLUTION_URL }}/message/sendText/{{ encodeURIComponent($('Configuração').item.json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').item.json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Responder a este contato?').item.json.number }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').item.json.RESPOSTA }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "delay",
              "value": "={{ 1500 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 2000) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "presence",
              "value": "composing"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "ac2bce36-ba5c-4769-b98a-949b0a6352d9",
      "name": "Enviar resposta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
